 <p className="muted small">ESPN public schedules, rosters and box scores. Provider availability and season conventions vary. Player datasets use the last six completed team games and exclude missing/DNP values; no missing value is converted to zero. Select “Load sports data” to apply the filters.</p>
 {rosterWarning&&<div className="notice">{rosterWarning}</div>}{catalogError&&<div className="notice">{catalogError} You can still use the attributed bundled example.</div>}{error&&<div className="notice error" role="alert">{error}{data?' The previously loaded dataset remains displayed below.':''}</div>}{data?.warning&&<div className="notice">{data.warning}</div>}
